  <li><strong>ChatGPT</strong> — Draft emails, research competitors, brainstorm ideas, analyze data</li>
  <li><strong>Canva</strong> — Create social media graphics, presentations, flyers, product images</li>
  <li><strong>Grammarly</strong> — Professional, error-free customer communication everywhere</li>
